{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"4a03067ef210734c","type":"group","x":-1800,"y":-480,"width":4320,"height":2360,"color":"6","label":"Incompatibilism"},
		{"id":"999c65dc8d81979d","type":"group","x":160,"y":-1400,"width":2440,"height":3560,"color":"4","label":"Free Will"},
		{"id":"cc6b265250a08c37","type":"group","x":-1720,"y":-370,"width":1360,"height":1720,"color":"5","label":"Determinism"},
		{"id":"7b1e80c9f20e57c7","type":"group","x":280,"y":-1280,"width":2200,"height":760,"color":"5","label":"Determinism"},
		{"id":"7ed6233f738beaa8","type":"group","x":1720,"y":-360,"width":680,"height":1680,"color":"3","label":"Libertarianism"},
		{"id":"3d63fadac212550d","type":"group","x":400,"y":-1160,"width":1960,"height":560,"color":"2","label":"Compatibilism"},
		{"id":"4f5022382f9c8142","type":"file","file":"6 - Notes/6.a - Claims/Free actions originate in the agent, a persisting entity and not an event.md","x":1890,"y":280,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"cfd15b0b98109acb","type":"file","file":"6 - Notes/6.a - Claims/Free actions are caused by prior events involving the agent, but this causation is indeterministic.md","x":1890,"y":800,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"9722b65f004a5da9","type":"file","file":"6 - Notes/6.a - Claims/Free actions are not the result of causation.md","x":1890,"y":-280,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"718f6da0442f8004","type":"file","file":"6 - Notes/6.a - Claims/The Basic Argument states that we don't have free will, regardless of whether compatibilism is true.md","x":-1600,"y":-230,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"cbfd023421e9b788",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Human control is limited, if not entirely nonexistent:** We are the products of our own existence.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-810,
			"y":-230,
			"width":320,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"226f07c269cebf5b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Rejecting of “Causa Sui”:** One cannot be the “cause of themselves.”",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-815,
			"y":-60,
			"width":330,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"54da7ec926356455",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**We lack “Basic Desert” responsibility**: People ought not to be punished for retributive reasons.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-890,
			"y":550,
			"width":300,
			"height":140
		},
		{"id":"ddbed2b0516d16f6","type":"file","file":"6 - Notes/6.a - Claims/Determinism and free will are incompatible.md","x":-310,"y":-260,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"bea68bab1e90e587","type":"file","file":"6 - Notes/6.a - Claims/The Luck Objection argues that indeterminism does not support Libertarianism.md","x":400,"y":680,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"1f7ac44bb01363bf",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**Indeterminism**: The past does not determine the future.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1040,
			"y":380,
			"width":380,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"2e21857c8f04e905",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**The Ability to Do Otherwise:** Given the same past and laws of nature, it is possible for an agent to have done otherwise at any particular moment.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1040,
			"y":170,
			"width":360,
			"height":160
		},
		{"id":"ad80c48656578790","type":"file","file":"6 - Notes/6.a - Claims/The Frankfurt Cases argue against the Principle of Alternative Possibilities.md","x":720,"y":-370,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"b7afcb8f8453296d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**The “Up to Us” Condition:** The ultimate source of actions originates in the acting agent, not in causal factors outside the control of the agent.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1040,
			"y":550,
			"width":380,
			"height":160
		},
		{"id":"09d4ece93c81d85e","type":"file","file":"6 - Notes/6.a - Claims/Determinism and free will are compatible.md","x":480,"y":-1060,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"60c3fdeb612d4da5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"**If we live in a physically determined universe, is anyone ever morally responsible for what they do?**",
			"styleAttributes":{"shape":"parallelogram"},
			"x":-600,
			"y":-660,
			"width":580,
			"height":80,
			"color":"1"
		}
	],
